 S('Total and average of {a}, {b}, {c}, {d}', 'Store the viewer counts {a}, {b}, {c} and {d} in a list named viewers. Start total at 0 and add every v to it in a for loop. After the loop print Total viewers: followed by total, then Average viewers: followed by total divided by the LENGTH of viewers.',
   L('viewers = [{a}, {b}, {c}, {d}]', 'total = 0', 'for v in viewers:', '    total = total + v', 'print("Total viewers:", total)', 'print("Average viewers:", total / len(viewers))'),
   [(3, '    total = v'), (2, 'for v in viewers'), (5, 'print("Average viewers:", total / v)')],
   'a b c d', [('120', '340', '95', '425'), ('50', '20', '80', '50'), ('300', '100', '200', '200'), ('10', '30', '20', '60')]),
